1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,520
Never get too attached to anyone who doesn't feel the same about you,

2
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:08,160
because one-sided expectations can quietly destroy you.

3
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:11,020
Some people become your whole world,

4
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:13,440
while you remain just a chapter in theirs.

5
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:15,540
So choose wisely.

6
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:17,280
Choose yourself.
